From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: RCT Screensaver <noreply@example.invalid>
Date: Mon, 2 Nov 2026 20:13:40 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Screensaver mode: renderer, volumes, weather and time of day
 settings

The mode's settings gain the drawing engine (switched live as Options does, by
recreating the window) and multithreaded rendering, master/sound/music volumes,
weather effects, a flag that lets the title screen run the climate
(gTitleRunsWeather; a park's Freeze weather cheat does not stop it there), and
its time of day (gTitleTimeOfDay: stock daylight, full night, or the day/night
cycle as in play), which the stock game runs only in play. Light effects are
applied only with the software engine, and in the mode they leave daylight as
it is (gTitleNeutralDaylight: no brightening in hot weather). The window size is
kept out of config.ini too, like the other values the mode overrides.
